## Testing

- **Unit** (vitest): Stores, utils, API handlers in `tests/unit/`
- **Component** (testing-library): Render + interaction in `tests/component/`
- **E2E** (playwright): Full user flows in `tests/e2e/`

Run individual test files: `pnpm vitest tests/unit/cart.test.ts`

## Deployment

Auto-deploy on push to `main` via Cloudflare Pages.
Preview deploys on pull requests.

```bash
wrangler d1 migrations apply DB    # Run D1 migrations
wrangler pages deploy              # Manual deploy (if needed)
```

## Conventions

- Svelte 5 runes only (`$state`, `$derived`, `$effect`) — no legacy `$:` syntax
- Server code in `src/lib/server/` — enforces the Workers boundary
- Conventional commits: `<type>(<scope>): <description>`
- Test before commit
